; Runnable version of the tree fort. Press F6 with this open, or:
;   "<godot>" --path 3d-rayman-type-game res://scenes/tree_fort_main.tscn
;
; Same four parts as the other two mains — game rules, a level, the player and
; the HUD. The player starts out on the plain facing the camp, so the first thing
; you see is the fort rather than the inside of it.

